    "organizerSessions": {
      "status": "Functional implementation follows the approved flow; visual refinement deferred. Existing normative tokens and component previews preserved.",
      "composition": "Existing cards, segmented tabs, skeletons, empty states, fields, buttons, and selectable chips support inventory and three-step editing. Native date/time and select controls use FieldTrigger surfaces matching TextField; date/time triggers expose selected accessibility values. Native selects open scrollable option sheets without measuring the trigger; iOS date/time uses a full-width native spinner sheet and Android native dialogs. Review separates schedule, players/price, and deadlines. Header and paired time/category fields stack above a 1.2 font scale. Shared text inputs and textareas expose meaningful accessibilityLabel/aria-label values.",
      "confirmation": "White, scrollable native bottom sheet with rounded top corners, safe-area padding, danger confirmation and bordered keep action. Cancellation reason uses the shared bordered textarea. Busy state prevents dismissal; errors remain inline.",
      "scope": "One/future editing and cancellation show calculated occurrence counts and date ranges. Loaded form/version snapshots remain pinned through background refresh.",
